NOTICE
------

This software ("Cog") is proprietary to Grey & Associates Ltd.
Use, reproduction, modification, or distribution of Cog requires a
valid licence issued by Grey & Associates Ltd. The four published
licence types are:

  free      Perpetual, single-seat, BYO-keys. No licence file
            required — the binary defaults to Free in absence of
            a paid licence. Subject to the terms at
            https://getcog.ai/terms/free.
  pro       Single-seat paid licence. Issued upon active
            subscription. Terms at https://getcog.ai/terms/pro.
  family    Up to four seats with parental administration. Terms
            at https://getcog.ai/terms/family.
  teams     Multi-seat commercial licence. Terms at
            https://getcog.ai/terms/teams.
  dev       30-day loopback-only developer licence. Minted with
            `cog license dev`. For evaluation and local development
            only.

